### Daylight API — no credentials are hardcoded in this file.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@csrf = paste-the-token-returned-by-the-request-below

### Readiness, without database details
GET {{host}}/health

### Obtain CSRF token; retain the JSESSIONID cookie between requests.
GET {{host}}/auth/csrf

### Current account (401 until signed in)
GET {{host}}/auth/me

### Current account's tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks

### Trash
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?trash=true

### Projects
GET {{host}}/api/projects

### Export current account's tasks and projects, never credentials
GET {{host}}/api/backup

### Sign out (replace @csrf with a fresh token)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### See /swagger-ui.html or the root README for write schemas.
